WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
One winter morning Kip woke up.

2
00:00:08.084 --> 00:00:10.448
The air was cold.

3
00:00:10.449 --> 00:00:13.479
The wind howled outside.

4
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.501
Kip shivered. "Brr!"

5
00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:18.273
He hugged himself.

6
00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:21.807
"It's so cold!" said Kip.

7
00:00:21.808 --> 00:00:28.557
A few snowflakes flew into his hole.

8
00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:30.879
Kip's eyes lit up.

9
00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.861
"It's snowing!" he cried.

10
00:00:33.862 --> 00:00:37.080
"Bird and I can play in the snow!"

11
00:00:37.081 --> 00:00:39.352
Kip jumped out of bed.

12
00:00:39.353 --> 00:00:42.208
He ran to his closet.

13
00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:46.713
He found a scarf, a hat, and boots.

14
00:00:46.714 --> 00:00:49.575
Kip put on the snow gear.

15
00:00:49.576 --> 00:00:56.188
He stepped out of his hole.

16
00:00:56.189 --> 00:00:58.620
A gust of wind blew.

17
00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:00.738
And Kip fell.

18
00:01:00.739 --> 00:01:03.697
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

19
00:01:03.698 --> 00:01:07.571
Poomf! He landed in the deep snow.

20
00:01:07.572 --> 00:01:10.839
Wind and snow blew all around.

21
00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.494
Bird looked down from her nest.

22
00:01:13.495 --> 00:01:17.474
"Kip, are you okay?" she called.

23
00:01:17.475 --> 00:01:20.793
"I'm okay," said Kip.

24
00:01:20.794 --> 00:01:23.671
"I'm going to play in the snow."

25
00:01:23.672 --> 00:01:27.557
"You can't play outside now," said Bird.

26
00:01:27.558 --> 00:01:30.931
"There's a blizzard!"

